      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "## Welcome\n\nA Review is a guided, interactive explanation of a code change. The document\nkeeps the important code, system views, and feedback in one place.\n"
      },
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "tone": "info",
        "title": "Tutorial",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "markdown": "This step used the interactive TutorialAuthoringConversation component.\n"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "### Your keybindings\n\nChoose your editor keys. Review highlights the active choice and uses its\nexisting extension and reload flow for Vim and Emacs.\n"
      },
      {
        "type": "callout",
        "tone": "info",
        "title": "Tutorial",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "markdown": "This step used the interactive TutorialKeymapPicker component.\n"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "### Put the keybindings to work\n\nThe editor below is live. Try hover, **Go to Definition**, or **Go to\nReferences** with the same commands you use in VS Code.\n"
