  {
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Commits and diffs",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "## Commits and diffs\n\nReview pins an exact base and head before the agent starts writing. Open\n**Commits** to see the change in author order. Expand the sample commit to see\nits files, then choose **Open diff** to inspect only that commit.\n\nThe **Diff** tab shows the complete change between the pinned base and head.\nChoose **Review** when you are ready to return to this tour.\n"
      },
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "Open the **Commits** tab.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "title": "Comments are threads",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "## Comments are threads\n\nYou can attach a thread to any part of the canvas. Move the pointer over the\ncode below, select the comment control in the left gutter, and write a note.\n"
      },
      {
        "type": "code_peek",
        "source": {
          "side": "head",
          "file": "src/inventory/inventory-service.ts",
          "fromLine": 4,
          "toLine": 8
        },
        "caption": "Inventory rejects invalid quantities"
      },
      {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": "Choose **Ask now**. The app starts an agent turn in a read-only checkout and\nputs its answer in the same thread. You can continue the conversation there.\n\nThe other standard choice, **Add to review**, holds feedback for the next\nauthoring round. This tour uses **Ask now** so you can see the agent reply\nimmediately.\n\nEvery comment is a thread anchored to one part of the Review. Use the **\\+**\nbutton in the toolbar to start a thread about the whole Review instead.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
